  "description": "There was a princess who was despised as the “Demon Princess.” Her wish was not a grand one. She simply wanted at least one person to be on her side. She longed for someone who would love her. Then, a ghost of unusual form appeared before her. That “ghost” swore his love to the Demon Princess.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
